# Chapter 11's independent check: the send's answer is lost, the app reconnects and sends again with
# the same operation ID, and the service stores one message.
tap home.login
type account.email you@example.com
tap account.submit
clock data release auth.email_start
type account.code 123456
tap account.verify
clock data release auth.email_verify
clock data release auth.account
tap shell.new
type composer.input hello
tap composer.send
clock data lose chat.send
logs
clock data release chat.send
state service.messages
clock data
